'''Neutralising potions''' are an item obtained in the Path of Apmeken within the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They are poured into the holes in the floor indicated by Apmeken's Sight to neutralise the dangerous fumes that can damage players if left unchecked. In groups, they are also used to cleanse a player of corruption in the challenge room.

